            "notes": "## Power\n\n[Circuit Breaker](item_ee0bd3b8-4c0d-40e6-a2a2-be20deef0e19) provides sustain and pairs well with [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48).\n\n[Primal Slam](item_9c54910d-33eb-4b3c-b04c-c9ac9b6f533a) is overall a great power, maybe even the best one, but it has a learning curve. If you wanna put time into it, try it. This adds even more mobility.\n\nIf the enemy team has easy-to-punch targets, you can take [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228). Landing a punch adds huge burst damage, and you can chain combos like jump \u2192 melee \u2192 M1/punch \u2192 jump again (cooldowns are so low) to kill a target and escape since you get the reset.  \n\nIn games with heavy healing, it\u2019s worth picking up [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) as early as this round (versus Brig + Moira backlines for example). If that\u2019s your plan, choose [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7) as your power.  \n\n## Item\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) adds more CDR and overall solid damage.  \n\nAlternatively, [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) provides similar CDR with added healing.  \n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is excellent against sticky enemies.  \n\n## Counterpick Items\n\nThese counterpick options won\u2019t be mentioned later\u2014buy them whenever you need them or if you have spare cash:  \n\n- [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) \u2014 great into armor or shields since you zap multiple targets.  \n- [Smart-Armor](item_2e0f4a99-c818-49c1-ace2-ba8d6f282da8) \u2014 if you\u2019re struggling against shotguns.  \n- [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) \u2014 boosts overall tankiness; strong with [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016).  \n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) \u2014 effective against headshot-heavy heroes like Cass, Soldier, Zen, or D.Va.  \n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) \u2014 good VS debuffs like Ashe\u2019s dynamite, Ana\u2019s sleep/nade, or JQ bleeds.  \n- [Premium Peanut Butter](item_c4cd51d3-e631-4c4c-9a9f-d586a6d0d5de) \u2014 similar to [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f), but synergizes well with low CDR.",
