            "notes": "## Items\n\nVery straightforward: buy [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) to hit 30% CDR. This makes you hyper-mobile with a 3s jump and gives your bubble a very short cooldown.  \n\nAs in the previous round, if the enemy has strong healing heroes or powers, grab [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). This item is incredibly valuable because healing is almost always present, and when DPS or supports dont get healed, they die very fast anyways.\n\nUpgrade [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) into a counterpick item, or swap it for [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) if you have the cash.",
