            "notes": "## Items\n\nFor sure take [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) in most games. It makes it much easier to kill enemies because there\u2019s almost ALWAYS healing, so it\u2019s a huge \"damage\" buff.\n\nOtherwise, take one of the other options from round 5 if you don\u2019t feel like you need the debuff, usually that's [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) for me.\n\nIf you have more cash, you can upgrade [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) with one of the items from round 5 as well, like [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).",
